  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Triple Bottom Line Inclusive Finance in Latin America. Promoting Climate Smart Finance &amp; Better Access</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The TIF initiative or program will have a three-pillar framework (financial, social and environmental, known as Triple Bottom Line2) and a twofold objective: downscaling financial services -being more inclusive tackling at the bottom of the pyramid- and promoting climate-smart finance.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
